{"result":{"acceptance_year":null,"advert_code":"238168","advert_description":"Pronajm\u011bte si p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00fd, prakticky za\u0159\u00edzen\u00fd byt 1+kk v Je\u0159abinov\u00e9 ulici, v obl\u00edben\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1sti Prahy 5 - Motol. \r\n\r\nByt nab\u00edz\u00ed obytn\u00fd prostor s kuchy\u0148sk\u00fdm koutem, kter\u00fd si m\u016f\u017eete uspo\u0159\u00e1dat jako pohodln\u00e9 m\u00edsto pro odpo\u010dinek i ka\u017edodenn\u00ed fungov\u00e1n\u00ed. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed vybaven\u00ed je j\u00eddeln\u00ed st\u016fl se \u017eidlemi, gau\u010d, postel a vestav\u011bn\u00e1 sk\u0159\u00ed\u0148. Kuchy\u0148 je vybavena lednic\u00ed s mraz\u00e1kem a my\u010dkou, v byt\u011b je tak\u00e9 pra\u010dka. D\u00edky tomu je mo\u017en\u00e9 nav\u00e1zat na st\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00ed vybaven\u00ed a pohodln\u011b se zabydlet bez po\u0159izov\u00e1n\u00ed z\u00e1kladn\u00edho n\u00e1bytku a spot\u0159ebi\u010d\u016f.\r\n\r\nK bytu n\u00e1le\u017e\u00ed balkon, kter\u00fd roz\u0161i\u0159uje obytn\u00fd prostor a nab\u00edz\u00ed m\u00edsto pro rann\u00ed k\u00e1vu nebo chv\u00edli odpo\u010dinku. Praktickou v\u00fdhodou pro n\u00e1jemn\u00edky s autem je parkovac\u00ed st\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed domem. Byt se nach\u00e1z\u00ed ve 4. pat\u0159e cihlov\u00e9ho domu.\r\n\r\nPraha 5 - Motol nab\u00edz\u00ed pohodln\u00e9 spojen\u00ed do dal\u0161\u00edch \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed m\u011bsta i p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00e9 z\u00e1zem\u00ed pro voln\u00fd \u010das. V okol\u00ed najdete zelen\u00e9 \u00fadol\u00ed, rybn\u00edky a golfov\u00fd are\u00e1l. K cestov\u00e1n\u00ed po Praze poslou\u017e\u00ed metro A a autobusov\u00e9 linkym nedaleko se nach\u00e1z\u00ed tak\u00e9 Fakultn\u00ed nemocnice.\r\n\r\nByt je vhodn\u00fd pro jednotlivce nebo p\u00e1r, kte\u0159\u00ed hledaj\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00e9 bydlen\u00ed s balkonem, parkov\u00e1n\u00edm a dobrou dopravn\u00ed dostupnost\u00ed.\r\n\r\nN\u00e1jemn\u00e9: 20 000 K\u010d/m\u011bs\u00edc\r\nZ\u00e1lohy na slu\u017eby: 5 000 K\u010d/m\u011bs\u00edc\r\nElekt\u0159ina: cca 800 K\u010d/m\u011bs\u00edc\r\nVratn\u00e1 kauce: 20 000 K\u010d\r\nProvize RK: 20 000 K\u010d\r\nK nast\u011bhov\u00e1n\u00ed: 1.12.2026","advert_images":[{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355190,"kind":2,"order":1,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUB13CvZ8zIKNorp/81a6.jpeg","width":1440},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355193,"kind":2,"order":4,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUChHuMSuKIKNosU/092a.jpeg","width":1440},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355199,"kind":2,"order":5,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUChHuMSuKIKNoss/1c7b.jpeg","width":1438},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355202,"kind":2,"order":6,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeBPfwtbvAIKNotJ/b047.jpeg","width":1440},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355205,"kind":2,"order":7,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUBiA4qVsGIKNotm/ce4f.jpeg","width":1440},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355208,"kind":2,"order":8,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUB13CvZ8zIKNouC/1e65.jpeg","width":608},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355211,"kind":2,"order":9,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUCHypVSx7IKNouj/5c2b.jpeg","width":1440},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355214,"kind":2,"order":10,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUCaRYmSydIKNovD/937e.jpeg","width":1440},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1080,"id":1017355217,"kind":2,"order":11,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUD9QxwTbJIKNovj/c17a.jpeg","width":1440}],"advert_name":"Pron\u00e1jem bytu 1+kk 48\u00a0m\u00b2","balcony":true,"balcony_area":5,"basin":false,"basin_area":null,"beginning_date":null,"building_area":null,"building_condition":{"name":"Velmi dobr\u00fd","value":1},"building_type":{"name":"Cihlov\u00e1","value":2},"category_main_cb":{"name":"Byty","val